      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Мика вкратце рассказал ящеру, что случилось с его родной планетой, и о совете марсианского ИИ: искать ответы в прошлом.",
      "emotion_tag": "[with curiosity]",
      "duration_ms": 8320,
      "sha256": "f5b6663cd2ea13dadb2d3d5e637345ffca9f4ce68d5ce0621f66d2e3543ac9c9"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P03_L002_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L002",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "И вот мы тут!",
      "emotion_tag": "[relieved]",
      "duration_ms": 1440,
      "sha256": "4cfa12dc5aa33646e211fd74a20e877ec1aa75159d52a11eac70e607c293f3c8"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P03_L003_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L003",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_031",
      "role": "pirate_lizard",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ",
      "text": "Думаю, вам стоит отправиться на Археон. Там ты узнаешь немного больше о нашем прошлом.",
      "emotion_tag": "[confidently]",
      "duration_ms": 5440,
      "sha256": "615ddbf7f6c640ecc6127547a46ef76166ad025344eb8c7342b7126f5daf9ea5"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P03_L004_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L004",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F02",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Корабль Мики приземлился на Археоне, неподалёку от археологического лагеря.",
      "emotion_tag": "[with wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 5120,
      "sha256": "2fe73478fcd0243172241cd6527a696893cd333895fafdb82bf6c7ee401cd579"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P03_L005_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L005",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_031",
      "role": "pirate_lizard",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ",
      "text": "Уверен, ты сможешь нам помочь!",
      "emotion_tag": "[encouragingly]",
      "duration_ms": 2720,
      "sha256": "1fbd728209beb29d19b866dd71ab0c107a43aa2454e260438161b7a7ff9cd747"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P03_L006_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L006",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_032",
      "role": "archeon_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "IKne3meq5aSn9XLyUdCD",
      "text": "Даже не знаю… чем я могу вам помочь.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hesitantly]",
      "duration_ms": 3600,
      "sha256": "d522d89152fbb7cc7ba047fdc1627d5dbcc357b2d332ebfa46eabbeed372aafb"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P03_L007_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L007",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Ящер отвёл Мику к своему знакомому — профессору археологии.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 4480,
      "sha256": "1ac83b5cb87a835e5769749171e5fe85df44c76b6a490fd9e2f48823c4fb0338"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P03_L008_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L008",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F04",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Археолог предоставил друзьям образцы и посоветовал найти своего коллегу в музее на Руне. Возможно, тот знает больше и поможет продолжить поиски.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopefully]",
      "duration_ms": 9760,
      "sha256": "e997bc5720c50b750ba131ba6eee04908c6718fa0b5287c16d959bdf41f0afef"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P03_L009_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L009",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F05",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_008",
      "role": "ship_navigation",
      "kind": "navigation",
      "voice_id": "SAz9YHcvj6GT2YYXdXww",
      "text": "НОВАЯ ЦЕЛЬ: РУНА — АРХЕОЛОГИЧЕСКИЙ МУЗЕЙ",
      "emotion_tag": "[clearly]",
      "duration_ms": 3840,
      "sha256": "395b04483fd63a9a4e6d6e2edc7f15c6a892b92e96e95ad4ca5892232148ca18"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH04_P03_L010_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L010",
      "language": "ru",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F06",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Цель была выбрана — и дружная компания снова отправилась в путь!",
      "emotion_tag": "[excitedly]",
      "duration_ms": 4560,
      "sha256": "5d478996609ca7309ae074e4115484566e66c61cebf707911b9724814da6a773"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH04_P03_L001_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L001",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika briefly told the lizard what had happened to his home planet and about the Martian AI’s advice: seek answers in the past.",
      "emotion_tag": "[with curiosity]",
      "duration_ms": 8320,
      "sha256": "290f4c4c0c37f250f568a9a78cd5ef29ea84f87de126bbcbaf0d366b503ca028"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH04_P03_L002_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L002",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "And here we are!",
      "emotion_tag": "[relieved]",
      "duration_ms": 1680,
      "sha256": "16bb97151ddb5556d11577006e6aa7e8cb28a6b844fe2f23341718a17ff16580"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH04_P03_L003_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L003",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_031",
      "role": "pirate_lizard",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ",
      "text": "I think you should visit Archeon. You might learn a little more about our history there.",
      "emotion_tag": "[confidently]",
      "duration_ms": 4080,
      "sha256": "c064578f4d72db9dbb497f4736b50c528231389a683fcc52912cd5c8ef9e1418"
    },
    {
