      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L006",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_032",
      "role": "archeon_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "IKne3meq5aSn9XLyUdCD",
      "text": "I’m not sure… what can I do for you?",
      "emotion_tag": "[hesitantly]",
      "duration_ms": 3600,
      "sha256": "5f8976e6a1da832c41ecb087884de3810a23cbd81975bda055c37533cea088d0"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH04_P03_L007_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L007",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "The lizard took Mika to an old acquaintance: a professor of archaeology.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 5040,
      "sha256": "2441eb9b5c7d9b2a612d7688e569758293a34f5077ca08a3f78a7dcd2bd3327d"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH04_P03_L008_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L008",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F04",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "The archaeologist gave the friends some samples and suggested finding his colleague at the museum on Runa. Perhaps that scholar knew more and could help them continue their search.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopefully]",
      "duration_ms": 9920,
      "sha256": "5eb3d1984fd72d9f88a42689c032730a78a941c36fa1399068aeb765397d5bfc"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH04_P03_L009_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L009",
      "language": "en",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F05",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_008",
      "role": "ship_navigation",
      "kind": "navigation",
      "voice_id": "SAz9YHcvj6GT2YYXdXww",
      "text": "NEXT DESTINATION: RUNA — ARCHAEOLOGICAL MUSEUM",
      "emotion_tag": "[clearly]",
      "duration_ms": 3760,
      "sha256": "3822b2ebe15852cf3f3a6855a63c8f2d860827c1b739e030445b97733ae5dfc3"
    },
    {
