    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P03_L002_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L002",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "¡Y aquí estamos!",
      "emotion_tag": "[relieved]",
      "duration_ms": 1600,
      "sha256": "cde57ccc5081426154f9a3160adc657475092978ae14cc4e9780db79e55e65e2"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P03_L003_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L003",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_031",
      "role": "pirate_lizard",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ",
      "text": "Creo que deberían visitar Archeon. Allí podrás descubrir algo más sobre nuestro pasado.",
      "emotion_tag": "[confidently]",
      "duration_ms": 5120,
      "sha256": "836a877477e1bbd8e01db1952ca04e057543d916e194df338a320cc07dd64ceb"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P03_L004_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L004",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F02",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "La nave de Mika aterrizó en Archeon, cerca de un campamento arqueológico.",
      "emotion_tag": "[with wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 5040,
      "sha256": "89b73f2a435ac3558a35ad6a14e41fc3816856c436c05379ba196986e573d212"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P03_L005_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L005",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_031",
      "role": "pirate_lizard",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ",
      "text": "¡Estoy seguro de que puedes ayudarnos!",
      "emotion_tag": "[encouragingly]",
      "duration_ms": 2560,
      "sha256": "be9a790fa396762351d2e9a224430bb943d72807d6604baecd96880d0022760f"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P03_L006_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L006",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_032",
      "role": "archeon_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "IKne3meq5aSn9XLyUdCD",
      "text": "Bueno… no sé muy bien cómo podría ayudarlos.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hesitantly]",
      "duration_ms": 4400,
      "sha256": "f326f96bea18eb5ed8a9d6662c81df065b19a4b0abf3784e656d762cd42397b4"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P03_L007_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L007",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "El lagarto llevó a Mika a conocer a un viejo amigo: un profesor de arqueología.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 5360,
      "sha256": "578291655fbf3cbaf53854e993747d7af8420b15a2d91d19b74a32f2d4ed7eb8"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P03_L008_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L008",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F04",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "El arqueólogo les entregó algunas muestras y les recomendó buscar a un colega suyo en el museo de Runa. Tal vez él supiera más y pudiera ayudarlos a seguir investigando.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopefully]",
      "duration_ms": 10080,
      "sha256": "6efed93c5688349179ade900a921c9a0480be103653b01b601a0fa2ce6e42bcb"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P03_L009_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L009",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F05",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_008",
      "role": "ship_navigation",
      "kind": "navigation",
      "voice_id": "SAz9YHcvj6GT2YYXdXww",
      "text": "PRÓXIMO DESTINO: RUNA — MUSEO ARQUEOLÓGICO",
      "emotion_tag": "[clearly]",
      "duration_ms": 3920,
      "sha256": "cd6f61a6d50f38660fcff2411cba2f4b43f9827a66eb1288145e8d2287f715e9"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH04_P03_L010_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L010",
      "language": "es",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F06",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Con el destino decidido, ¡nuestros amigos emprendieron otra etapa de su aventura!",
      "emotion_tag": "[excitedly]",
      "duration_ms": 5120,
      "sha256": "05e4a73fa09be11d6042f2d467bb7a2d73f75100ffa152df2d9b458a825b1644"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P03_L001_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L001",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika raconta brièvement au lézard ce qui était arrivé à sa planète natale et le conseil de l’IA de Mars : chercher des réponses dans le passé.",
      "emotion_tag": "[with curiosity]",
      "duration_ms": 8480,
      "sha256": "9493dfb6feb6ab7380157f35f85ce1ccb1df7b6677d81ff1f2a504ec2e800333"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P03_L002_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L002",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Et nous voilà !",
      "emotion_tag": "[relieved]",
      "duration_ms": 1600,
      "sha256": "edacee60e01db03bbc70a844650dad9f41a510d038566946d35610ddf7e6a8e9"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P03_L003_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L003",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_031",
      "role": "pirate_lizard",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ",
      "text": "À mon avis, vous devriez aller sur Archéon. Tu en apprendras davantage sur notre passé.",
      "emotion_tag": "[confidently]",
      "duration_ms": 5280,
      "sha256": "c8c2eb9df834d3e97b09454b5b6478f63560fbda912f6b2a4607d7823577e387"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P03_L004_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L004",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F02",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Le vaisseau de Mika se posa sur Archéon, tout près d’un camp de fouilles archéologiques.",
      "emotion_tag": "[with wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 5360,
      "sha256": "03bf3ff2264a313e9f4af448affaa6958ac70bc8aac7599516285b6262a2e0d1"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P03_L005_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L005",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_031",
      "role": "pirate_lizard",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ",
      "text": "Je suis sûr que tu peux nous aider !",
      "emotion_tag": "[encouragingly]",
      "duration_ms": 2400,
      "sha256": "711a127604679c386b9ce2ca75e3467641f3157a94016aeb2f2aef416721505d"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P03_L006_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L006",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_032",
      "role": "archeon_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "IKne3meq5aSn9XLyUdCD",
      "text": "Euh… je ne sais pas trop comment je pourrais vous aider.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hesitantly]",
      "duration_ms": 3600,
      "sha256": "093a8a077155dca80040aa261bb5dda64e21aac947eb6c2c1b81a33867ba99ba"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P03_L007_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L007",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Le lézard conduisit Mika auprès d’une vieille connaissance : un professeur d’archéologie.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 5600,
      "sha256": "c568d43ab6526542c8aa4c99a59908e285ab3daa155f6b763a8d125ab75f90de"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P03_L008_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L008",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F04",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "L’archéologue donna quelques échantillons aux amis et leur conseilla de rencontrer un collègue au musée de Runa. Peut-être en saurait-il plus et pourrait-il les aider à poursuivre leur enquête.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopefully]",
      "duration_ms": 9840,
      "sha256": "27e9802df88b6ac98249be8dacbd2c23c22b672c8b4ea8f710c4e4dfa734514d"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P03_L009_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L009",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F05",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_008",
      "role": "ship_navigation",
      "kind": "navigation",
      "voice_id": "SAz9YHcvj6GT2YYXdXww",
      "text": "PROCHAINE DESTINATION : RUNA — MUSÉE ARCHÉOLOGIQUE",
      "emotion_tag": "[clearly]",
      "duration_ms": 3920,
      "sha256": "7ed1c24998988b1933bb4cba44003b96df30dabcf5dd916f7c525c99a7e49afb"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH04_P03_L010_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L010",
      "language": "fr",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F06",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Leur destination était choisie : les amis reprirent la route vers de nouvelles découvertes !",
      "emotion_tag": "[excitedly]",
      "duration_ms": 5040,
      "sha256": "2461facd62b5bd1fabfd77736dc5d86481dedd2eccc176f8f8f3a6bf33c8abd0"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P03_L001_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L001",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mika erzählte der Echse kurz, was auf seinem Heimatplaneten geschehen war, und vom Rat der Mars-KI: Er sollte in der Vergangenheit nach Antworten suchen.",
      "emotion_tag": "[with curiosity]",
      "duration_ms": 9520,
      "sha256": "ce925e2d6de0bc73749dc9fd9f739027cd40ed49b7b6ffbd51e3d688886a3179"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P03_L002_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L002",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_001",
      "role": "mika",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "XjcBo3s44Dqh64FhOpGk",
      "text": "Und jetzt sind wir hier!",
      "emotion_tag": "[relieved]",
      "duration_ms": 1840,
      "sha256": "1f0a9c27f71b4b78cf8870c9488fa580630c4bb2672285acf1a8f219e0d15531"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P03_L003_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L003",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F01",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_031",
      "role": "pirate_lizard",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ",
      "text": "Ich finde, ihr solltet Archeon besuchen. Dort erfährst du mehr über unsere Vergangenheit.",
      "emotion_tag": "[confidently]",
      "duration_ms": 5040,
      "sha256": "ee921068f6ea82ca419c126c2c6d4a7328c204409b982babf4f178ee61579cb3"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P03_L004_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L004",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F02",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Mikas Raumschiff landete auf Archeon, ganz in der Nähe eines archäologischen Lagers.",
      "emotion_tag": "[with wonder]",
      "duration_ms": 5680,
      "sha256": "4b433797d2b18d24258ef40bda7b8d0ba334ac7c4a45b106e092ab38acae2f5d"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P03_L005_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L005",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_031",
      "role": "pirate_lizard",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "TX3LPaxmHKxFdv7VOQHJ",
      "text": "Ich bin sicher, du kannst uns helfen!",
      "emotion_tag": "[encouragingly]",
      "duration_ms": 2400,
      "sha256": "0782e2ab5530a0fcdefa124aaf5757d2b947fe55f37fe641c089c275b67355f5"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P03_L006_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L006",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_032",
      "role": "archeon_archaeologist",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "IKne3meq5aSn9XLyUdCD",
      "text": "Nun ja… ich weiß nicht recht, wie ich euch helfen könnte.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hesitantly]",
      "duration_ms": 4480,
      "sha256": "4ad4cd02988784f742568fd9a8918124ff4f58122aeb55b8542b4a7c9ee1d5c2"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P03_L007_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L007",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F03",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Die Echse brachte Mika zu einem alten Bekannten: einem Professor für Archäologie.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warmly]",
      "duration_ms": 5280,
      "sha256": "c0cc5c9b8819a16d5472e44f298ded9ba3eb341ad344b9cbf5650c5fe066717d"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P03_L008_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L008",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F04",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Der Archäologe gab den Freunden einige Fundstücke mit und riet ihnen, einen Kollegen im Museum auf Runa aufzusuchen. Vielleicht wusste er mehr und konnte ihnen bei der Suche weiterhelfen.",
      "emotion_tag": "[hopefully]",
      "duration_ms": 10720,
      "sha256": "cee304e9c633efd5967f22a7bcb442f2d7328bd080c911eb8427d6a4a9c8c864"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P03_L009_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L009",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F05",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_008",
      "role": "ship_navigation",
      "kind": "navigation",
      "voice_id": "SAz9YHcvj6GT2YYXdXww",
      "text": "NEUES ZIEL: RUNA — ARCHÄOLOGISCHES MUSEUM",
      "emotion_tag": "[clearly]",
      "duration_ms": 3920,
      "sha256": "807d66a84102d587332d4ebaca5d0e152bfd024764fb6095a1403b800ac9f0af"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH04_P03_L010_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH04_P03_L010",
      "language": "de",
      "frame_id": "CH04_P03_F06",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Das Ziel stand fest, und die Freunde machten sich auf zur nächsten Etappe ihrer Reise!",
      "emotion_tag": "[excitedly]",
      "duration_ms": 5120,
      "sha256": "7f161170bd8e2f6676e094ba77f4f7e36fa47b7b07c59f135e56db7b0f95331c"
    }
  ],
  "shared_sfx": []
}
